  Not so much lost technology as lost techniques.  More importantly, the
Egyptians were good engineers, and built the best tools they could with the
materials and power sources they had.  This surprises many people who don't
realize how much you can do with wood, stone, rope, water, and a lot of muscle
power.

> I think that the perceptual blinders making these people search for
